      "body": "Help me turn in exercises/13-spotify-exercise.ipynb.\n\n1. Check that the notebook file exists and has saved outputs. If the cells have no\n   outputs, stop and tell me to run all cells and save with Ctrl+S.\n2. Run git status. Stage the notebook. If pixi.toml or pixi.lock changed, stage them too.\n   Do not stage anything else.\n3. Commit with the message \"complete exercises/13-spotify-exercise.ipynb\".\n4. Push to origin. If the push is rejected, stop and tell me. Do not force push.\n5. Print the link to the notebook on my fork on GitHub. It looks like\n   https://github.com/<my-username>/codespace/blob/main/exercises/13-spotify-exercise.ipynb\n   Get my username from the origin remote.",
